#: src/reference/reference/sbt-update.md:209
msgid ""
"The repositories used by the launcher can be overridden by defining `~/.sbt/"
"repositories`, which must contain a `[repositories]` section with the same "
"format as the `Launcher` configuration file. For example:"
msgstr ""
"可通过定义 `~/.sbt/repositories` 覆盖 launcher 使用的仓库，该文件必须包含与 "
"`Launcher` 配置文件格式相同的 `[repositories]` 部分。例如："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-update.md:213
msgid ""
"```\n"
"[repositories]\n"
"local\n"
"my-maven-repo: https://example.org/repo\n"
"my-ivy-repo: https://example.org/ivy-repo/, [organization]/[module]/"
"[revision]/[type]s/[artifact](-[classifier]).[ext]\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-update.md:220
msgid ""
"A different location for the repositories file may be specified by the "
"`sbt.repository.config` system property in the sbt startup script. The final "
"step is to set `sbt.override.build.repos` to true to use these repositories "
"for dependency resolution and retrieval."
msgstr ""
"可通过 sbt 启动脚本中的 `sbt.repository.config` 系统属性指定仓库文件的不同位置。"
"最后一步是将 `sbt.override.build.repos` 设为 true，以使用这些仓库进行依赖解析和获取。"

